     1                0.2000,   0.2500,   0.3000,   0.4000,   0.5000,   0.7500,   1.0000,   1.5000, 
     1                2.0000,   3.0000,   4.0000,   5.0000 / 
 
 
      Data a1(1:20) / 4.1314301, 4.1314301, 4.6555722, 4.551444, 4.8502153, 5.3735463, 5.9698523, 7.7540492, 6.0018897, 4.2516444,
